{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1059834/block/singleImage/3246019/df/01M5HVEM7CYT9T9WCWN5SNKQSM.jpg?updatedAt=1792674466\"/><figcaption>白石角University Hill兩房跌穿3年買入價 投資者666萬接貨｜二手成交</figcaption></figure><p>中原地產新界東豪宅白石角分行經理曾嘉滙表示，大埔白石角 University Hill 第 2B 期最新錄得 3 座低層 A2 室成交，單位實用面積約 439 方呎，兩房間隔，日前議價後以 666 萬元沽出，呎價約 15,171 元。 料享最高 3.6 厘回報 曾嘉匯透露，新買家為投資者，見屋苑環境舒適，單位價錢合理，即購入單位投資收租，單位市值月租約 1.8 萬至 2 萬元，買家料可享約 3.2 厘至 3.6 厘租金回報。 據了解，原業主於 2023 年以 695 萬元購入上址，持貨約 3 年，現轉售帳面損失約 29 萬元或 4.2% 離場。 即睇大埔白石角 University Hill 第 2B 期放盤 (House730)</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1059834/block/singleImage/3246023/wm/01M5HVGE5E0S82PZ25AV6KM4R4.JPG?updatedAt=1792674466\"/><figcaption>University Hill兩房跌穿3年買入價。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T17:40:39.345844+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":394,"images":2,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T15:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T03:57:59.882506+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T17:38:10.339145+00:00","content_hash":"c48c9cb5f47d77a66badec3a095198447cf0c85f5d67660be98bf7b3778d1e80","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-22T17:40:39.345844+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}